## Aliased model / findings

`ox_alpha` (`stealth/ox-alpha`) is not a standalone model. Z.ai confirmed on 2026-08-26 that this alias resolved to GLM-5.3-Flash during the stealth preview (Aug 20–26, 2026). Full specs and benchmarks for the underlying model are already researched and filed under `model/glm-5.3-flash/Cat_Jam.md`.

### Specs (inherited from GLM-5.3-Flash)

- 320B total / 18B active, native multimodal (text/image/video), 1M context, 128K output
- Z.ai pricing $0.15/$0.50, MIT weights
- See `model/glm-5.3-flash/Cat_Jam.md` for numbers.

### Raw benchmarks found for `ox_alpha` itself

No verified independent benchmark score was published under the `ox_alpha` alias itself. Published benchmarks cite `GLM-5.3-Flash` (e.g., AA Intelligence Index 57 (v4.1.1) / 41.8 (v4.3.2), DeepSWE 63.4, etc.). The alias was retired (OpenRouter/stealth listing no longer serves). No separate verified public benchmark exists for `ox_alpha` as an exact ID.

Self-exclusion: no verified public benchmarks under the `ox_alpha` slug ⇒ saved as `.md.excluded`.

